            <div xml:id="d893">

                <pb facs="0930" n="812" xml:id="pg812"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6731/119: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-03-27T15:00:00-05:00">March 27, 1929—3
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>17. You are authorized, in accordance with the procedure you outlined in your 17,
                    March 24, 11 a.m., paragraph numbered 2, to proceed with a new exchange of
                    notes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
